            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "**Isotopes** are atoms of the same element that have the **same number of protons** but a **different number of neutrons**.",
            "start": 26,
            "end": 149
          },
          {
            "id": "p4",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "This means isotopes have the same **atomic number** but different **mass numbers**.",
            "start": 151,
            "end": 234
          },
          {
            "id": "p5",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
